            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "A <color=#ffe04b>Memory Factor</color> is the smallest unit that makes up Civilization. By dismantling the <color=#ffe04b>Mnemonic Clusters</color> they form, you can obtain <color=#ffe04b>Memory Factors</color> . Then, offer them to the <color=#ffe04b>Memory Core</color> to obtain blessings from space itself."
